para:
This is a read-only format. Each Timeline segment is converted as follows:
a visit (a place you stopped) becomes a waypoint, named by its semantic type (HOME, INFERRED_WORK, and so on);
an activity (a trip) becomes a track holding its start and end points, named by the activity type (WALKING, CYCLING, ...); a parked vehicle location, if present, becomes a waypoint;
a timelinePath (a recorded point trail) becomes a track.
